  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT FOR PEACEBUILDING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The project is outlined with a territorial and people-centered approach with an emphasis on women and youth, to overcome some of the barriers faced by communities, collectives, and individuals in contexts with territorial fractures that have shaped development trajectories, preventing them from enjoying the dividends of peace. The project aims to promote local economic development by strengthening value chains, fostering inclusive employment, and creating enabling conditions for peacebuilding. T</narrative>
  </description>
